# Cursed Windbreaker (2U): its enters trigger manifests dread (CR 701.62a) - of Llanowar Elves and Lightning Bolt the Elves goes face down as a
# 2/2 and the Bolt to the graveyard - then attaches the Equipment to that creature (CR 701.3a), so the face-down creature has flying. Equip {3}
# moves it to Memnite (1/1 gains flying) and the face-down creature loses it (CR 702.6a, 301.5c): refused with only two of the three sources
# untapped, then paid with exactly three.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cursed Windbreaker
Memnite
Plains
Llanowar Elves
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Cursed Windbreaker.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Lightning Bolt)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Llanowar Elves
? Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield..Keywords = Flying
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Battlefield.Cursed Windbreaker.Activate(Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Cursed Windbreaker.Activate(Memnite)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Cursed Windbreaker.AttachedTo = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield..Keywords = (absent)
